    "The local district health office / CMHO (Chief Medical Health Officer) holds the authoritative, current phone directory for facilities an ASHA actually refers patients to — this is genuinely local knowledge, not something scrapeable, and should be collected directly from the supervising PHC when onboarding ASHAs in a district.",
    "data.gov.in health facility datasets are mostly aggregate counts (number of PHCs/CHCs per state), not per-facility contact directories."
